    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trooops is a puzzle-tactics roguelite deckbuilder where you command a bizarre crew in, grid-based combat.<br><br>Rearrange your soldiers into deadly formations to protect your ship at all costs. A thoughtful match-3 twist to find the perfect attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/a4cf4c4a511362db3488356e4f8d6c63.poster.avif?t=1754070569\" width=250 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/a4cf4c4a511362db3488356e4f8d6c63.webm?t=1754070569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/a4cf4c4a511362db3488356e4f8d6c63.mp4?t=1754070569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sacrifice trooops to survive devilish attacks, or see your boat slowly sinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/915ddad8e63bf51e1119319fac9ed746.poster.avif?t=1754070569\" width=700 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/915ddad8e63bf51e1119319fac9ed746.webm?t=1754070569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/915ddad8e63bf51e1119319fac9ed746.mp4?t=1754070569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your crew, upgrade their gear, recruit unique castways to face ever-shifting creatures combat. <br><br>Board enemy ships, find hidden treasures, and reach unknown shores as you combat across a procedurally generated archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up and stay afloat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
